      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the connection request was for a IPV4V6 and we get ONLY_IPV4_ALLOWED or ONLY_IPV6_ALLOWED, is that considered a permanent fail? There is an option of retrying with IPV4 and the connection may succeed. Thats the reason ONLY_IPVX_ALLOWED has been omitted here.",
