      "writtenOn": "2013-02-14T01:38:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed but we shouldn\u0027t retry IPV4V6 so in that sense its permanent. Currently if a RIL returns this we\u0027ll never succeed because there is no explicit handling and we\u0027ll just retry forever in CDMA and have to wait a full retry cycle for GSM, not good.\n\nSo I think it should be a permanent error.",
